gger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.7.4","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":1676839169590,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.kquBnQ0kObZztnBc","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"eEzJDCkucHy6LtLO","name":"Snag Weapon","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature attempts to attack the sklaggan with a melee weapon and rolls a critical miss;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The sklaggan encloses its biological armor around the attacker's weapon. The sklaggan attempts to @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.Dt6B1slsBy8ipJu9]{Disarm} the triggering creature, using its Thievery modifier in place of Athletics.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"icHTvcEiAfMPasy8","name":"Toxic Shadows","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The sklaggan releases shadowy organic compounds in its armor to debilitate creatures it approaches. The sklaggan Strides up to its Speed. Any creature within 5 feet of the Sklaggan's path takes [[/r 4d6[mental]]] damage and must attempt a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:22|name:Toxic Shadows DC|traits:damaging-effect,mental,shadow|showDC:gm]{Fortitude} save.</p>\n\n<p>The sklaggan can't use Toxic Shadows again for [[/br 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage and is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2}.</p>\n"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["mental","shadow"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"w9EoOCyODn46U7MN","name":"Fist","type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["agile","finesse"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"bchv789jbxvru40iao9w":{"damage":"2d4+5","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":13},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"2MYOaX2HFNQwpwgO","name":"Occult Innate Spells","type":"spellcastingEntry","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"ability":{"value":"cha"},"spelldc":{"value":14,"dc":22,"mod":0},"tradition":{"value":"occult"},"prepared":{"value":"innate","flexible":false},"showSlotlessLevels":{"value":false},"proficiency":{"value":0},"slots":{"slot0":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot1":{"prepared":[],"value":3,"max":3},"slot2":{"prepared":[],"value":3,"max":3},"slot3":{"prepared":[],"value":2,"max":2},"slot4":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot5":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot6":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot7":{"prepared":[],"value":1,"max":1},"slot8":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot9":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot10":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot11":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0}},"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null},"showUnpreparedSpells":{"value":true},"displayLevels":{}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"3GYz13HYvCCVR5Hp","name":"Telekinetic Projectile","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/telekinetic-projectile.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You hurl a loose, unattended object that is within range and that has 1 Bulk or less at the target. Make a spell attack roll against the target. If you hit, you deal bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing damage-as appropriate for the object you hurled-equal to 1d6 plus your spellcasting ability modifier. No specific traits or magic properties of the hurled item affect the attack or the damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You deal double damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You deal full damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"telekinetic-projectile","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["attack","cantrip","concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":true,"formula":"1d6","type":"untyped","category":null,"materials":[],"kinds":["damage"]}},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"2MYOaX2HFNQwpwgO"},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"type":"interval","interval":1,"damage":{"0":"1d6"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.60sgbuMWN0268dB7","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"BhDu6p8PunQonrPG","name":"Shield","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/shield.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You raise a magical shield of force. This counts as using the Raise a Shield action, giving you a +1 circumstance bonus to AC until the start of your next turn, but it doesn't require a hand to use.</p>\n<p>While the spell is in effect, you can use the Shield Block reaction with your magic shield. The shield has Hardness 5. After you use Shield Block, the spell ends and you can't cast it again for 10 minutes. Unlike a normal Shield Block, you can use the spell's reaction against the magic missile spell.</p>\n<p>Heightening the spell increases the shield's Hardness.</p>\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.spell-effects.Jemq5UknGdMO7b73]{Spell Effect: Shield}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The shield has Hardness 10.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The shield has Hardness 15.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The shield has Hardness 20.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> The shield has Hardness 25.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"shield","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","force"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":null,"time":{"value":"1"},"duration":{"value":"until the start of your next turn","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"2MYOaX2HFNQwpwgO"},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.TVKNbcgTee19PXZR","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"4f9o8EnYDRalJMRK","name":"Daze","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/daze.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You cloud the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals mental damage equal to your spellcasting ability modifier; the target must attempt a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"daze","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","manipulate","mental","nonlethal"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"60 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 round","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":true,"formula":"0","type":"mental","category":null,"materials":[],"kinds":["damage"]}},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"will","basic":true}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"2MYOaX2HFNQwpwgO"},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"type":"interval","interval":2,"damage":{"0":"1d6"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.4gBIw4IDrSfFHik4","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"8UFsaG9Omm0Rk1DG","name":"Mindlink","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/mindlink.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You link your mind to the target's mind and mentally impart to that target an amount of information in an instant that could otherwise be communicated in 10 minutes.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"mindlink","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 willing creature"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"2MYOaX2HFNQwpwgO","heightenedLevel":1},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.D442XMADp01qJ7Cs","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"A4auH3fBORdB3IAl","name":"Mindlink","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/mindlink.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You link your mind to the target's mind and mentally impart to that target an amount of information in an instant that could otherwise be communicated in 10 minutes.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"mindlink","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 willing creature"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"2MYOaX2HFNQwpwgO","heightenedLevel":1},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.D442XMADp01qJ7Cs","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"UKq8bRbV1tjwIFCE","name":"Mindlink","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/mindlink.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You link your mind to the target's mind and mentally impart to that target an amount of information in an instant that could otherwise be communicated in 10 minutes.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"mindlink","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 willing creature"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"2MYOaX2HFNQwpwgO","heightenedLevel":1},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.D442XMADp01qJ7Cs","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"OdzOZct4GLRw8ftn","name":"Status","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/status.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>As long as you and the target are on the same plane of existence and both alive, you remain aware of its present state. You know the target's direction from you, distance from you, and any conditions affecting it.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The spell's range increases to 30 feet, and you can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"status","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","detection","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 willing living creature"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 day","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"2MYOaX2HFNQwpwgO","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"4":{"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"target":{"value":"10 willing living creatures"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.HTou8cG05yuSkesj","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"shkLMJeaDJ9aYCrX","name":"Calm Emotions","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/calm-emotions.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You forcibly calm creatures in the area, soothing them into a nonviolent state; each creature must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> Calming urges impose a -1 status penalty to the creature's attack rolls.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> Any emotion effects that would affect the creature are suppressed and the creature can't use hostile actions. If the target is subject to hostility from any other creature, it ceases to be affected by calm emotions.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but hostility doesn't end the effect.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.spell-effects.Qr5rgoZvI4KmFY0N]{Spell Effect: Calm Emotions}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"calm-emotions","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","emotion","incapacitation","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":{"value":10,"type":"burst"},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":true},"damage":{},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"will","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"2MYOaX2HFNQwpwgO","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.b515AZlB0sridKSq","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"7K1eWtHAENOTO7ru","name":"Blur (Self Only)","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/blur.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The target's form appears blurry. It becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed}. As the nature of this effect still leaves the target's location obvious, the target can't use this concealment to Hide or Sneak.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"blur","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","illusion","manipulate","visual"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"2MYOaX2HFNQwpwgO","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.3JG1t3T4mWn6vTke","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"JjRJaNFGikBL1miX","name":"Vampiric Touch","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/vampiric-touch.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Your touch leeches the lifeblood out of a target to empower yourself. You deal 6d6 negative damage to the target. You gain temporary Hit Points equal to half the negative damage the target takes (after applying resistances and the like). You lose any remaining temporary Hit Points after 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"vampiric-touch","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","death","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":3},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 living creature"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"formula":"6d6","type":"void","category":null,"materials":[],"kinds":["damage"]}},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"fortitude","basic":true}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"2MYOaX2HFNQwpwgO","heightenedLevel":3},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"type":"interval","interval":1,"damage":{"0":"2d6"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.N1Z1oLPdBxaSgrEE","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"g93yfpsjy5ofgaAq","name":"Dream Message","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/dream-message.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You send a message to your target's dream. The message is one-way, up to 1 minute of speech (roughly 150 words). If the target is asleep, they receive the message instantly. If not, they receive it the next time they sleep. As soon as they receive it, the spell ends, and you know the message was sent.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures you know by name and have met in person. You must send the same message to all of them; the spell ends for each creature individually.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"dream-message","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":3},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature you know by name and have met in person"},"range":{"value":"planetary"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"10 minutes"},"duration":{"value":"1 day","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"2MYOaX2HFNQwpwgO","heightenedLevel":3},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"4":{"target":{"value":"10 creatures you know by name and have met in person"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.yM3KTTSAIHhyuP14","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"ioJkFj66oE6SOydp","name":"Plane Shift (Self Only; To Shadow Plane Only)","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/plane-shift.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You and your allies traverse the barriers between planes of existence. The targets move to another plane, such as the Plane of Fire, the Shadow Plane, or the Abyss. You must have specific knowledge of the destination plane and use a magic tuning fork created from material from that plane as a focus for the spell. While the tuning forks for most prominent planes are uncommon, just like the spell plane shift, more obscure planes and demiplanes often have rare tuning forks. The spell is highly imprecise, and you appear 1d20x25 miles from the last place one of the targets (of your choice) was located the last time that target traveled to the plane. If it's the first time traveling to a particular plane for all targets, you appear at a random location on the plane. Plane shift doesn't provide a means of return travel, though casting plane shift again allows you to return to your previous plane unless there are extenuating circumstances.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"plane-shift","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","teleportation"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":7},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 willing creature, or up to 8 willing creatures joining hands"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"10 minutes"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"2MYOaX2HFNQwpwgO","heightenedLevel":7},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.5bTt2CvYHPvaR7QQ","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"pPGK9Hp2bzv86cs2","name":"Skagappa","type":"consumable","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/alchemical-items/alchemical-tools/orgin-unguent.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"pf2-icon\">1</span> Interact; must be set within 5 feet of where a creature typically sleeps (such as under its pillow or bed)</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Sklaggans use these strange balls of writhing worms to intercept and interpret the dreams of sleeping subjects.</p>\n<p>For 1 week, any creature that sleeps within 5 feet of the skagappa has increasingly fitful dreams. If it was @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.HL2l2VRSaQHu9lUw]{Fatigued}, the creature must succeed at a @Check[type:flat|dc:5] when it sleeps. On a failure, the creature remains fatigued until it gets another full night's rest.</p>\n<p>At any point during this week, a creature who takes possession of the skagappa can tap into its occult powers to learn 10 minutes' worth of information about the creature whose sleep has been affected. To do so, the creature must cast <em>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.D442XMADp01qJ7Cs]{Mindlink}</em> on the skagappa and succeed at a @Check[type:occultism|dc:15|name:Skagappa DC|traits:alchemical,consumable,mental|showDC:gm]{Occultism} check. On a failed check, the spell is wasted, though the caster can attempt the check additional times by casting <em>mindlink</em> again. Regardless, the same information is imparted each time the skagappa is tapped into. One week after it was placed near a creature's bedside, the skagappa unravels and its constituent worms slither away, destroying the item.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["alchemical","consumable","mental"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":4},"quantity":1,"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0.1},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0},"hardness":0,"price":{"value":{"gp":18}},"equipped":{"carryType":"held","handsHeld":1},"containerId":"null","size":"med","material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unusual Ball","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/potions.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"category":"other","uses":{"value":1,"max":1,"autoDestroy":true,"per":null,"autoUse":true},"damage":null,"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"spell":null,"stackGroup":null,"activation":{"type":"","cost":0,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":null,"units":""},"target":{"value":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"autoUse":{"value":true,"_deprecated":true}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Item.Fmum2zYpRJRvwFxj","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"2KKWFVhXjIXcRe6X","name":"Telepathy 100 feet","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Telepathy]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"telepathy","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["aura","magical","mental"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.kdhbPaBMK1d1fpbA","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"pf2e":{"lootable":false},"core":{}},"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":65,"temp":0,"max":65,"details":""},"ac":{"value":22,"details":"","base":22},"allSaves":{"value":"+1 status to all saves vs mental"},"speed":{"value":30,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":""}},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["aklo","shadowtongue"],"details":"sklaggan; (can’t speak any language); telepathy 100 feet"},"level":{"value":5},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Hailing from the subterranean depths of the Plane of Shadow, sklaggans are scrawny, bipedal abominations with mouthless faces, wiry limbs, and spindly fingers tipped with dirt-encrusted claws. They invade other planes and use perverse organic technology to capture and conduct experiments on native inhabitants. To a sklaggan, every living creature is worthy of invasive—and thorough—examination.</p>\n<p>The organic materials and weapons sklaggans employ are far from any natural substance familiar to dwellers of the Material Plane. Rather, these tools are as alien as the sklaggans themselves, consisting of disturbing biological parts such as writhing coils made of muscle tissue, slimy stones that visibly inhale and exhale from microscopic pores, and tentacular rods of spongy brain-like matter wrapped in slick black chitin.</p>\n<p>One of a sklaggan's most popular implements is a throbbing, fist-sized siphoning device called a skagappa. When a sklaggan has selected a subject for experimentation, it notes the creature's sleeping patterns and hides a skagappa near the subject's bedside. Repeated exposure to this device, usually about a week, can leave a subject exhausted enough for easy capture, to say nothing of the psychic information intercepted by and stored within the skagappa. Sklaggans set up semi-mobile laboratories in remote parts of the region they are studying in order to conduct their gruesome experiments on abducted locals more quickly.</p>\n<h2>Organic Shifters</h2>\n<p>Sklaggans shift from their subterranean laboratories to other planes and back via strange rituals that make use of their unique bio-technology. Non-sklaggan researchers' attempts to replicate these rituals always result in failure and, more often than not, nightmarish physical mutations.</p>\n<h2>Monster Part Subsystem</h2>\n<p><strong>Sklaggan Creature 5 </strong></p>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 18/45/80 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning), armor (light, medium, heavy), perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Deception, Medicine, Occultism, Stealth, Thievery)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, constitution, dexterity, energy resistant (positive), evil, intelligence, mental, negative, sensory (darkvision), spells (Occult: blur, calm emotions, daze, dream message, mindlink, plane shift, shield, status, telekinetic projectile, vampiric touch), wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary","authors":"Jon Hewitt","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_